02:30.510 --> 02:35.930
Satoshi and Latios!

02:30.510 --> 02:35.930
Satoshi and Latios!

02:30.510 --> 02:35.930
Satoshi and Latios!

02:47.190 --> 02:48.440
<b>That just now...</b>

02:48.440 --> 02:50.530
<b>It had to be dream sharing.</b>

02:50.530 --> 02:56.160
<b>A power that lets us see 
 what Latios sees, through Latias.</b>

02:56.160 --> 02:57.370
<b>Latias!</b>

02:58.450 --> 03:00.830
<b>Where’s Latios right now?</b>

03:08.170 --> 03:08.960
<b>Satoshi?</b>

03:08.960 --> 03:09.750
<b>What is it?</b>

03:12.840 --> 03:15.260
<b>Got it, Latias.</b>

03:18.140 --> 03:21.470
<b>Everyone, return! 
 Latios is in trouble.</b>

03:23.100 --> 03:24.270
<b>Let’s go!</b>

03:24.270 --> 03:27.150
<b>All right! 
 Let’s follow her on Haganail!</b>

03:30.730 --> 03:31.730
<b>Go ahead!</b>

03:44.450 --> 03:47.250
<b>Have you been watching over us 
 all this time?</b>

04:03.140 --> 04:04.430
<b>That time...</b>

04:06.850 --> 04:08.560
<b>You were the one 
 who saved me!</b>

04:08.900 --> 04:10.060
<b>Thank you!</b>

04:21.200 --> 04:22.950
<b>What’s this?</b>

04:28.040 --> 04:29.040
<b>Latios!</b>

04:38.340 --> 04:39.380
<b>Who’s that?</b>

04:43.800 --> 04:46.390
<b>Don’t think you can escape me.</b>

04:50.140 --> 04:51.650
<b>Latios, look out!</b>

05:00.530 --> 05:02.530
<b>Latias, what happened to Latios?!{original: Latias, how’s Latios?!}</b>

05:10.920 --> 05:12.380
<b>She can’t tell?</b>

05:12.380 --> 05:13.710
<b>I’m really worried.</b>

05:13.710 --> 05:15.920
<b>That guy riding the Sazandra...</b>

05:15.920 --> 05:18.630
<b>...must have been a Pokémon Hunter.</b>

05:24.720 --> 05:27.390
<b>The sun’s setting. 
 It’s too dangerous to keep going.</b>

05:27.390 --> 05:28.680
<b>We should rest for a while.</b>

05:28.680 --> 05:30.060
<b>Got it.</b>

05:30.060 --> 05:31.440
<b>Just wait, Latias!</b>

05:31.440 --> 05:33.600
<b>Latios will be okay!</b>

05:33.600 --> 05:35.570
<b>He won’t lose to 
 some Pokémon Hunter!</b>

05:36.480 --> 05:38.610
<b>He’ll contact you again!</b>

05:51.960 --> 05:54.460
<b>First time at HQ in ages, meow.</b>

05:54.920 --> 05:56.250
<b>Just you wait, meow.</b>

05:56.250 --> 05:59.960
<b>I’ll become a Team Rocket legend 
 even if I have to do it alone, meow!</b>

06:01.970 --> 06:03.970
<b>Here I am again.</b>

06:03.970 --> 06:05.720
<b>Just you wait...</b>

06:06.430 --> 06:09.930
<b>I’ll become a Team Rocket legend 
 even if I have to venture by myself!</b>

06:15.650 --> 06:19.900
<b>I <i>will</i> be a Team Rocket legend!</b>

06:41.510 --> 06:43.340
<b>Here, Satoshi.</b>

06:43.340 --> 06:44.840
<b>Oh, thanks.</b>

06:45.970 --> 06:50.310
<b>You said that Latias was injured 
 when you found her.</b>

06:50.310 --> 06:53.430
<b>Could she have been attacked 
 by that hunter?</b>

06:54.520 --> 06:58.110
<b>Yeah. Then Latias alone 
 managed to escape.</b>

06:58.110 --> 07:01.190
<b>Maybe Latios gave her 
 the chance to get away.</b>

07:01.190 --> 07:02.440
<b>Yeah.</b>

07:06.280 --> 07:07.950
<b>Hey, why don’t you eat with us?</b>

07:17.000 --> 07:19.170
<b>You’ll have lots of flying 
 to do tomorrow.</b>

07:19.170 --> 07:21.000
<b>We’ve gotta save Latios!</b>

07:21.920 --> 07:24.760
<b>You can’t battle 
 on an empty stomach.{a saying, replacing ikusa(battle of a war) with batoru(as in Pokémon battle)}</b>

07:24.760 --> 07:26.590
<b>Gotta make sure 
 you’re fully recharged.</b>

07:34.430 --> 07:36.190
<b>So you like it?</b>

08:04.050 --> 08:05.210
<b>Latias?</b>

08:05.840 --> 08:07.840
<b>What? What’s going on?</b>

08:20.520 --> 08:21.730
<b>Latias!</b>

08:40.500 --> 08:42.000
<b>All right, let’s go!</b>

08:42.000 --> 08:43.590
<b>Return, Haganail!</b>

08:57.270 --> 08:58.140
<b>Latios!</b>

09:04.770 --> 09:06.860
