09:39.560 --> 09:44.480
<b>Dragon</b>

09:39.560 --> 09:44.480
<b>m 0 0 m 1290 960 l 1530 960 l 1530 1024.5 l 1290 1024.5</b>

09:52.450 --> 09:54.280
<b>Latios, hear me out!</b>

09:58.580 --> 10:00.830
<b>My name’s Satoshi.</b>

10:02.080 --> 10:04.080
<b>I want to help you!</b>

10:26.060 --> 10:27.440
<b>Pikachu!</b>

10:31.820 --> 10:33.400
<b>Crunch!</b>

10:36.910 --> 10:38.280
<b>Let’s go, Kasumi!</b>

10:38.280 --> 10:39.200
<b>Yeah!</b>

10:39.830 --> 10:41.160
<b>Scale Shot!</b>

10:48.250 --> 10:50.250
<b>Let Latias and Latios go!</b>

10:50.250 --> 10:53.010
<b>Thank you for guiding me 
 all this way.</b>

10:53.010 --> 10:54.970
<b>Even bringing me a Latias.</b>

10:55.300 --> 10:58.100
<b>As it turns out, 
 luck was still on my side.</b>

10:58.100 --> 11:00.350
<b>What are you saying?! 
 This isn’t funny!</b>

11:01.890 --> 11:04.770
<b>Why, this is their destiny.</b>

11:04.770 --> 11:08.400
<b>They’re beautiful— 
 meaning they’re valuable.</b>

11:08.400 --> 11:10.190
<b>So many people desire them!</b>

11:18.660 --> 11:20.830
<b>Sazandra, Dragon Pulse!</b>

11:30.590 --> 11:32.590
<b>Yes... That’s right.</b>

11:32.590 --> 11:35.170
<b>If you move, 
 you know what happens to Latias.</b>

11:36.680 --> 11:38.680
<b>First, though... Will be you!</b>

11:38.680 --> 11:40.550
<b>Stop!</b>

11:44.310 --> 11:44.810
<b>Satoshi!</b>

11:49.190 --> 11:50.770
<b>Stay out of my way!</b>

11:50.770 --> 11:51.570
<b>Latios!</b>

12:02.410 --> 12:03.870
<b>Move it!</b>

12:08.750 --> 12:10.250
<b>You’re finished.</b>

12:16.090 --> 12:16.970
<b>Latias!</b>

12:34.860 --> 12:36.690
<b>Dragon Pulse!</b>

12:46.250 --> 12:48.120
<b>100,000 Volts!</b>

12:53.170 --> 12:55.170
<b>Go, Haganail!</b>

12:58.550 --> 12:59.760
<b>Stone Edge!</b>

13:04.100 --> 13:05.350
<b>Electroweb!</b>

13:10.980 --> 13:12.690
<b>Causing trouble again...</b>

13:15.900 --> 13:17.820
<b>Latios, follow me!</b>

13:23.200 --> 13:25.200
<b>Go, Ohsubame!</b>

13:27.750 --> 13:29.330
<b>Follow that hunter!</b>

13:32.500 --> 13:34.210
<b>Are you okay, Latios?!</b>

13:37.000 --> 13:39.210
<b>Just stay still for a second.</b>

13:41.470 --> 13:43.390
<b>We need to treat your wounds!</b>

13:56.980 --> 14:00.030
<b>I want to save Latias.</b>

14:00.650 --> 14:02.280
<b>You do too, right?</b>

14:07.620 --> 14:09.200
<b>Let’s go, Latios.</b>

14:28.100 --> 14:28.890
<b>So fast!</b>

14:28.890 --> 14:30.680
<b>Hurry, Haganail!</b>

14:46.490 --> 14:47.450
<b>Over there.</b>

14:48.950 --> 14:50.540
<b>So they’re here.</b>

15:08.470 --> 15:09.680
<b>Ohsubame!</b>

15:14.810 --> 15:16.350
<b>Great work, Haganail!{Sasuga. line}</b>

15:16.350 --> 15:17.860
<b>Where’s that guy?</b>

15:29.660 --> 15:33.790
<b>Hey, do you get the feeling 
 that hunter led us here on purpose?</b>

15:33.790 --> 15:36.170
<b>Yeah. Haganail, use Smack Down!</b>

15:41.750 --> 15:43.130
<b>You’re in my way!</b>

15:47.430 --> 15:48.680
<b>How could he?!</b>

15:50.800 --> 15:52.560
<b>No way!</b>

15:54.600 --> 15:57.020
<b>Here, you can’t fly freely.</b>

15:57.020 --> 15:58.310
<b>So what will you do?!</b>

16:01.190 --> 16:04.230
<b>Satoshi! 
 Destroy that mechanism!</b>

16:04.230 --> 16:07.070
<b>If you do, Latias and the others 
 will go back to normal!</b>

16:07.070 --> 16:07.820
<b>Got it!</b>

16:08.570 --> 16:10.530
<b>Latios, fire an Aura Sphere.{batch change: Latios, fire a Guiding Wave Sphere/Wave Sphere.}</b>

16:12.370 --> 16:15.200
<b>Don’t worry. I’ll handle Latias.</b>

16:21.080 --> 16:22.960
<b>Dragon Pulse!</b>

16:38.270 --> 16:40.100
<b>Pikachu, use Iron Tail!</b>

17:09.260 --> 17:10.970
<b>Now you’ve done it.</b>

17:14.220 --> 17:15.430
<b>Dragon Pulse!</b>

17:22.650 --> 17:23.860
<b>Wait, Latios!</b>

17:24.270 --> 17:26.530
<b>You need to be...</b>

17:26.530 --> 17:28.280
<b><i>...crushed</i> into the ground!</b>

17:37.540 --> 17:39.620
<b>Don’t be reckless, Latios!</b>

17:47.840 --> 17:49.550
<b>How about battling by my side?</b>

17:52.220 --> 17:54.260
<b>I wanna take him down, too.</b>

18:01.390 --> 18:06.150
<b>Interesting! 
 What, are you Latios’s trainer now?</b>

18:06.150 --> 18:08.860
<b>I’m not holding back!</b>

18:08.860 --> 18:10.190
<b>Psychokinesis!</b>

18:14.740 --> 18:16.990
<b>Psychic moves won’t work!</b>

18:16.990 --> 18:18.540
<b>Crunch!</b>

18:25.000 --> 18:26.000
<b>They vanished?!</b>

18:26.420 --> 18:27.500
<b>Aura Sphere!{batch change: Guiding Wave Sphere!/Wave Sphere!}</b>

18:50.530 --> 18:51.990
<b>Amazing!</b>

18:51.990 --> 18:56.030
<b>The Psychokinesis was a ploy 
 to throw Sazandra off its guard.</b>

18:58.280 --> 18:59.870
<b>We did it, Latios!</b>

19:05.000 --> 19:06.500
<b>How dare you...?</b>

19:06.500 --> 19:09.630
<b>How dare you? How dare you? 
 How <i>dare</i> you?!</b>

19:19.890 --> 19:21.260
<b>Ms. Junsa!</b>

19:21.640 --> 19:23.680
<b>All’s well that ends well.</b>

19:23.680 --> 19:25.890
<b>Think about what you’ve done!</b>

19:27.900 --> 19:30.900
<b>Right... I won’t do it again.</b>

19:44.790 --> 19:45.910
<b>You’re leaving already?</b>

19:46.370 --> 19:48.210
<b>But your wounds haven’t—</b>

20:02.060 --> 20:03.930
<b>Let’s battle together again sometime.</b>

20:23.330 --> 20:26.370
<b>I wonder what kind of home 
 they’re heading back to.</b>

20:26.370 --> 20:27.330
<b>Hmm...</b>

20:28.120 --> 20:32.750
<b>Some place of repose, 
 untouched by humans... perhaps.</b>

20:38.090 --> 20:39.930
<b>Maybe I should head back, too.</b>

20:46.600 --> 20:49.270
<b>Latias... Latios...</b>

20:49.980 --> 20:56.070
